title: 'pallet-beefy: reject a set_new_genesis delay that overflows the block number'
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      set_new_genesis now returns InvalidConfiguration when adding delay_in_blocks to the
      current block number would overflow, instead of panicking. GenesisBlock is left unchanged.
crates:
  - name: pallet-beefy
    bump: patch
